{# roomhive/host/pending-tenants.html.twig
   Host › Pending Tenants — 1:1 port of legacy booking/pendingtenants.php
   (SIGN-TO-ACCEPT edition). Extends host/base.html.twig; sidebar
   "Pending Tenants" highlights via active_nav = 'pending'.

   What the page does (same as legacy):
     • Cards for every booking with status='pending' on the host's
       listings: listing photo, title + map-pin location, applicant
       row (avatar, or the temporary navy/gold circle-user-round icon
       when no avatar is uploaded — same 36px box, honey ring, so
       layout never shifts), Verified / Not Verified pill (✓ stays
       text — legacy kept it as text too), applied date, payment
       status pill (Fully Paid / Advance Paid / Pending), View
       Receipt link, dates strip (calendar-days) and ₱ total with
       Reject / Accept buttons.
     • Clicking a card opens the Application Details modal (listing,
       tenant, personal photo for in-person recognition — click for
       full size, payment, dates, guests, total).
     • ACCEPT = SIGN-TO-ACCEPT: opens the signature pad; drawing
       ink enables "Sign & Accept", which saves the signature then
       accepts, removes the card and redirects to the guest's
       receipt. REJECT confirms and goes straight to the endpoint.
     • Canvas fix carried over: the pad is sized when it OPENS
       (skip 0x0 while hidden; re-apply stroke settings after every
       resize — resizing wipes the 2D context state).

   Icons — official lucide.dev art via admin/_macros.html.twig:
     map-pin → ui.icon('pin') · circle-user-round → ui.icon('circle-user-round')
     file-text → ui.icon('file-text') · calendar-days → ui.icon('calendar-days')
     pen-line → ui.icon('pen-line')
   (circle-user-round / file-text / calendar-days / pen-line are NEW
   keys added to the macro for this page — additive, all previous
   keys untouched.)

   Actions (JS at the bottom, 1:1 with the legacy script; only the
   fetch URLs moved to the Symfony URL map):
     • POST /host/bookings/{id}/sign    legacy sign-receipt.php
       (body booking_id + signature dataURL; TODO route — 404s until
       that file is pasted and ported)
     • POST /host/bookings/{id}/accept  legacy accept-booking.php
       (TODO route — same one HostListingsController documents)
     • POST /host/bookings/{id}/reject  legacy reject-booking.php
       (TODO route)
     • Receipt link → /payment/confirmation/{id} (legacy
       payment-confirmation.php?id=N — already ported in
       PaymentController, route app_payment_confirmation)
     • Sidebar badge sync after accept/reject (legacy refreshBadges,
       selector now targets /host/pending-tenants).

   Pairs with: HostPendingTenantsController (route
   /host/pending-tenants, name app_host_pending_tenants, GET only).
#}
{% extends 'host/base.html.twig' %}
{% import 'admin/_macros.html.twig' as ui %}

{% set active_nav = 'pending' %}

